Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:23:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gateway: a compaction's trigger goes to the key whose list
 lacks the model when none that lists it can be asked it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

What changed
- compactionCarriers kept only the candidates that can be asked Codex's
  own compaction on the Responses API. One of those candidates can sit in
  planned.unlisted: the vendor's lists hold the model to another key, one
  that can't be asked it there (its key speaks another protocol, so
  WithKey leaves no Responses URL and carriesCompaction is false for it).
  nativeCompactionFor, the setting that kept the trigger in the first
  place, judged the provider carries it — the provider level — and then
  the key level cleared every candidate, and the request was refused 400
  carrierError: "none of the keys or accounts that serve the model now
  can be asked it on the Responses API", the same "on, but told it can't
  go there" #2642 fixed for a compaction's writer. When nothing that
  lists the model can carry the compaction, the carrier whose own list
  lacks the model is taken back from unlisted and asked, as the last
  resort a compaction's writer is (checkpointReaders) and a key whose
  list lacks the model is (perKeyBarred); its row leaves the routing
  page's left, so it isn't shown both tried and unlisted, skipped. With
  no carrier at all, the refusal stays as it was.
- docs/subsystems/gateway-routing.md says the trigger's narrowing does
  this.

Run
- TestNativeCompactionTriggerThroughAKeyWhoseListLacksTheModel (two keys,
  m1 listed to a chat-protocol key and another model to the responses
  key, native compaction on): red on 8233eada — 400 carrierError, the
  relay asked 0 times; green with the fix — 200, the trigger at the
  responses key's relay, the seal back to Codex, the chat key never
  asked, the tried key out of the trace's Left.
- Ablation: internal/gateway/native_compaction.go alone reverted to
  8233eada, test kept, the same red; restored, green.
- go test -tags nogui -p 2 ./internal/gateway/: ok 332.5s.
- gofmt -l internal/gateway/ clean; go vet -tags nogui darwin/linux/
  windows clean; go build darwin/linux/windows ok.

